   WERT          1.50    2.00    2.60    3.10    3.90    4.80    5.80    6.90
   WERT          2.80    3.60    4.60    5.50    6.80    8.20    9.80   11.50
   WERT          4.50    5.80    7.20    8.60   10.50   12.50   14.80   17.20
   WERT          6.20    7.90    9.80   11.60   14.00   16.60   19.50   22.50
END

